      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAILAWAY GIN (7) hit the ground running from an outside draw with a fast early split, paving the way for a neck win at this track over 300m in 17.15. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Looks to have an edge on most of these. SUMMER KOBIE (2) was below best at his last start when 7th at this track following a second place finish (17.00) there two back. Solid record here at the distance winning four races. Should be in this for a long way. STARTING OUT (1) stalked the lead from a middle box and kept coming to win (22.55) at Shepparton in Special conditions Veteran race over 390m. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Bold showing expected again. DEVIL IN ME (8) hit the frame here last start so don't underestimate.",
